    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A lonely journey through the darkness of night... But are you truly alone?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Limb Driver</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Limb Driver</strong>, a first-person psychological horror game, pulls the player into a mysterious and unsettling world. Abandoned roads, forgotten memories, and a terror lurking in the shadows... As the line between reality and illusion begins to blur, will you be able to make the right choices?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630640/extras/e27fceb3c8f6707da1d09d334e3271a2.poster.avif?t=1754894052\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630640/extras/e27fceb3c8f6707da1d09d334e3271a2.webm?t=1754894052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630640/extras/e27fceb3c8f6707da1d09d334e3271a2.mp4?t=1754894052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combining exploration, survival, and narrative-driven horror, <strong>Limb Driver</strong> offers players mechanics such as driving, puzzle-solving, and environmental interaction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630640/extras/e450fbbe13825850377dd71309234796.poster.avif?t=1754894052\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630640/extras/e450fbbe13825850377dd71309234796.webm?t=1754894052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630640/extras/e450fbbe13825850377dd71309234796.mp4?t=1754894052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intense atmosphere and photorealistic graphics</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VHS and retro film aesthetic</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story shaped by NPC dialogue and environmental clues</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choices matter \u2014 events unfold based on your decisions</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you make it to the end of the road?</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A lonely journey through the darkness of night... But are you truly alone?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Limb Driver</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Limb Driver</strong>, a first-person psychological horror game, pulls the player into a mysterious and unsettling world. Abandoned roads, forgotten memories, and a terror lurking in the shadows... As the line between reality and illusion begins to blur, will you be able to make the right choices?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630640/extras/e27fceb3c8f6707da1d09d334e3271a2.poster.avif?t=1754894052\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630640/extras/e27fceb3c8f6707da1d09d334e3271a2.webm?t=1754894052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630640/extras/e27fceb3c8f6707da1d09d334e3271a2.mp4?t=1754894052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combining exploration, survival, and narrative-driven horror, <strong>Limb Driver</strong> offers players mechanics such as driving, puzzle-solving, and environmental interaction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630640/extras/e450fbbe13825850377dd71309234796.poster.avif?t=1754894052\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630640/extras/e450fbbe13825850377dd71309234796.webm?t=1754894052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630640